```

### Fix 4: Line 218 - Replace `JsonSerializer.Deserialize<UserAssignedIdentity>(property0.Value.GetRawText())`

UserAssignedIdentity has a static DeserializeUserAssignedIdentity method.

Replace:
```csharp
                        dictionary.Add(new ResourceIdentifier(property0.Name), JsonSerializer.Deserialize<UserAssignedIdentity>(property0.Value.GetRawText()));
